### Login do Funcionario
# @name LogReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "larissa@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### Cadastro de Obra
POST http://localhost:3000/obra
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Larissa",
    "cnpj": "12345678912",
    "tipoObra": "casa"
}

### Cadastro de Obra
POST http://localhost:3000/obra
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Ueslei",
    "cnpj": "12345678913",
    "tipoObra": "prédio"
}

### Cadastro de Obra
POST http://localhost:3000/obra
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Weslei",
    "cnpj": "12345678914",
    "tipoObra": "apartamento"
}

### Listagem de Obra
GET  http://localhost:3000/obras
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

### Consultar Obra por código
GET  http://localhost:3000/obra/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

### Consultar Obra por nome
GET  http://localhost:3000/obra/Weslei
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{LogReq.request.body.token}}

